  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>本模組僅為測試版本。</strong></span></h1><p>這是由Orca-san製作的《咒術迴戰》模組的擴充插件，能完整相容於Epic Fight戰鬥系統。靈感來自於絕對傳奇人物mikku500。</p><p><span>此模組透過新增適當的武器能力、自訂攻擊風格以及咒具的格擋機制，完美地整合了兩個系統</span><span><sup></sup></span><span>。此外還包含了全面的進階生物修補，確保《咒術迴戰》模組中的實體與頭目在Epic Fight引擎下能正確地戰鬥與使用動畫</span><span><sup></sup></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>此外，這個擴充插件還為遊戲導入自訂視覺強化效果，包括空心編織籠的3D模型</span><span><sup></sup></span><span>。</span></span></p><h2><strong><span><span>需求模組：</span></span></strong></h2><p><span><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sorceryfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu Craft (Sourcery Fight)</a>&nbsp;by Orca_san_</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>Epic Fight</span></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>Weapons of miracles</span></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-impactful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>Epic Fight - Impactful</span></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-indestructible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>Epic Fight - Indestructible</span></span></a></p><h1><span><span><strong>如有任何錯誤，敬請回報。</strong></span></span></h1><h2><span><span><strong>若有任何改善建議，歡迎留言。</strong></span></span></h2><p><span><span><strong>我創作的其它模組：</strong></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jujutsu-better-random\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu better random</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jujutsu-better-menu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu better menu</a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jjk-hub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu hub</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
